<title>USA: SoftNet says ex-CEO resigns from board.</title>
<headline>SoftNet says ex-CEO resigns from board.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST, Ill. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoftNet Systems Inc said former president and chief executive John Jellinek and director Phillip Kenny resigned from the company's board.</p>
<p>SoftNet said it concurrently sold its operations that support its Fujitsu maintenance customer base in Chicago to Jellinek and Kenny for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
